Package: vnmap
Title: Map the Provinces and Municipalities of Viet Nam
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Yuki", "Matsuura", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "matsuura.yuki.200095@gmail.com")
Description: Convenient 'ggplot2' choropleth maps of Viet Nam using either
    the 34 provincial-level administrative units effective from July 2025 or
    the preceding 63-unit geography. Includes name normalization, official
    administrative codes, socio-economic region grouping, simple-feature
    boundary data, and 2024 provincial population and regional-economic
    indicators. Historical boundaries are derived from public-domain
    'geoBoundaries' data. Current province and commune boundaries share a
    pinned, redistributable reference-map-derived source and explicit vintage.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
